### 🌍 Environment Configuration (`tfvars`)

#### `environments/dev/dev.tfvars`
```hcl
environment             = "dev"
aws_region              = "us-east-1"
bucket_name             = "dev-app-assets"
db_instance_class       = "db.t3.micro"
db_multi_az             = false
db_username             = "dev_admin"
# db_password           = "managed-via-sops-or-env-var"
db_subnet_group_name    = "dev-db-subnet-group"
db_security_group_ids   = ["sg-0dev1234567890abc"]
assume_role_policy      = file("${path.module}/trust-policy-dev.json")
common_tags             = { Team = "platform", Project = "webapp" }
```

#### `environments/prod/prod.tfvars`
```hcl
